<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Vision room for kit_cam. Includes the frozen walk plant and does not
  edit it. Named scene geometry so a later vision step can point at
  "entrance". This is not a navigation map and not a planner input.
  One camera: the plant's kit_cam.
  The entrance body is a visual doorframe: jambs, lintel, white inner
  trim, and side walls, plus a floor mat. Visual geometry only.
  No hinge, no joint, no lever, no latch, and no swinging panel.
-->
